{
  "info": {
    "name": "Allsvenskan Predictor - Demo",
    "description": "Demo av Allsvenskan Tipsspel-API:et.\n\nKörordning:\n1. Utan API-key → 401 (visar authorizer)\n2. Fel API-key → 403 (visar validering)\n3. GET /matches (visar DynamoDB + Lambda)\n4. GET /matches?round=1 (visar GSI-query)\n5. POST /predictions (visar affärslogik + EventBridge)\n6. GET /predictions (visar persistent data)\n\n**VG-krav som visas:**\n- Event-driven: logPrediction triggas av PredictionCreated via EventBridge\n- Authorizer: API-key validering",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://DIN-API-URL.execute-api.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "DIN-API-NYCKEL",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Utan API-key → 401 Unauthorized",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/matches",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["matches"]
        },
        "description": "Visar att authorizer nekar request utan API-key.\n→ Förväntat svar: 401 Unauthorized"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Fel API-key → 403 Forbidden",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "fel-nyckel-123"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/matches",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["matches"]
        },
        "description": "Visar att authorizer nekar request med felaktig API-key.\n→ Förväntat svar: 403 Forbidden"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET /matches - Hämta alla matcher",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/matches",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["matches"]
        },
        "description": "Hämtar alla Allsvenskan-matcher från DynamoDB.\n→ Visar: API Gateway → Lambda → DynamoDB\n→ Förväntat: 200 med array av matcher"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. GET /matches?round=1 - Filtrera per omgång",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/matches?round=1",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["matches"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "round",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Hämtar matcher för omgång 1 via GSI (round-date-index).\n→ Visar: Query med Global Secondary Index\n→ Förväntat: 200 med 8 matcher"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. POST /predictions - Skapa ett tips",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"matchId\": \"1234567\",\n  \"predictedHome\": 2,\n  \"predictedAway\": 1\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/predictions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["predictions"]
        },
        "description": "Skapar ett nytt tips. Triggar EventBridge → logPrediction.\n→ Visar: Affärslogik, DynamoDB PutItem, EventBridge-event\n→ Förväntat: 201 med prediction-objekt\n→ Kör igen för att visa duplikatskydd (409)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. GET /predictions - Hämta alla tips",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{apiKey}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/predictions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["predictions"]
        },
        "description": "Hämtar alla sparade tips från DynamoDB.\n→ Visar: Persistent data – tipset vi just skapade finns här\n→ Förväntat: 200 med array innehållande vårt tips"
      }
    }
  ]
}
